<title>MALAYSIA: Arab-Malaysian Finance six-mth net up.</title>
<headline>Arab-Malaysian Finance six-mth net up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30</p>
<p>		 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 109.32	 vs	84.20</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 54.0	  vs	42.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		   694.88	 vs     506.71</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   163.23	 vs     130.20</p>
<p>    Total assets	  13,954.7	  vs  11,232.8</p>
<p>    Loans/advances	10,009.0	  vs   8,173.5</p>
<p>    Deposits/borrowings 12,486.8	  vs  10,103.1</p>
<p>NOTE: The full name of the finance company is Arab-Malaysian Finance Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
